!! gate ~ write

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`write` params=`who/seat-or-hand ocap/write-on-the-layer-written ~ the Kahu predicate, then the face's write cap on each layer the consequence writes`>>
```

