<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ wiki-unreached · conflict · tiddler-delete-in-a-family · delete-mode-needed · reveal-top-unwritable · rendered-derives · cross-face-write-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`wiki-unreached` params=`cure/[[engine.record.removes title/<title> recipe/default]] ~ no wiki this face hosts or holds a share of answers the slug`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`conflict` params=`cure/[[engine.record.reads title/<title> recipe/default]] ~ the record moved past the base; read again, then delete with the live base`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`tiddler-delete-in-a-family` params=`cure/[[engine.record.removes title/<title> recipe/default family/true]] ~ the title stands in a meme family; the answer quotes the consequence, and family names the act`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`delete-mode-needed` params=`cure/[[engine.record.removes title/<title> recipe/default mode/reveal]] ~ a lower layer holds the title too; kapae hides it, reveal surfaces it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`reveal-top-unwritable` params=`cure/[[engine.record.removes title/<title> recipe/default mode/kapae]] ~ the face cannot write the layer holding the top record, so a reveal retracts nothing`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`rendered-derives` params=`~ only the renderer writes a rendered tiddler; it leaves when its source drops projection: rendered`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`cross-face-write-refused` params=`~ a delete writes the face it wears; target names a face to read`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ removed · absent · refused · conflict · dry

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`removed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[title decision mode tombstoned retracted hash consequence]] ~ the act landed; mode reads plain, kapae, reveal or cut`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`absent` params=`exit/3 ~ nothing stood to remove`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/4 fields/[[refusal why consequence]] ~ the family law or a lower layer refused; the consequence rides the answer and nothing moved`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`conflict` params=`exit/4 fields/[[hash]] ~ the base read stale; nothing moved`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`dry` params=`exit/0 fields/[[dry needs diff hints]] ~ a dry delete: the answer the real delete would give, the base it needs and the carrier's seat hints; nothing landed`>>
```

